# Walkthrough - Button Import and Usage Fixes

I have fixed the issue where the [Button](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/ui/Button.tsx#41-63) component was being imported as a default export despite being a named export. I also corrected some incorrect prop usage in the [AboutCTA](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/about/AboutCTA.tsx#4-28) component.

## Changes Made

### UI Components

#### [header.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/ui/header.tsx)
- Corrected the import of [Button](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/ui/Button.tsx#41-63) to use named import:
```diff
-import Button from "./Button";
+import { Button } from "./Button";
```

### About Page Components

#### [AboutCTA.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/about/AboutCTA.tsx)
- Corrected the import of [Button](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/ui/Button.tsx#41-63).
- Updated [Button](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/ui/Button.tsx#41-63) props:
    - Replaced `size="large"` with `size="lg"`.
    - Wrapped the button content in a `Link` component and used `asChild` prop on the [Button](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/ui/Button.tsx#41-63) because the shadcn [Button](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/ui/Button.tsx#41-63) does not accept an `href` prop directly.
```diff
-import Button from "@/components/ui/Button";
+import { Button } from "@/components/ui/Button";

...

-                <Button
-                    href="/contact"
-                    variant="secondary"
-                    size="large"
-                    className="bg-white text-blue-600 border-white hover:bg-blue-50 hover:text-blue-700"
-                >
-                    Agendar Consulta
-                </Button>
+                <Button
+                    asChild
+                    variant="secondary"
+                    size="lg"
+                    className="bg-white text-blue-600 border-white hover:bg-blue-50 hover:text-blue-700"
+                >
+                    <Link href="/contact">
+                        Agendar Consulta
+                    </Link>
+                </Button>
```

